%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f5dcffc070f2c7d45a208d446b2d3945, type: 3}
  m_Name: KAITO
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::VocaloidTCG.StoryData
  id: story-kaito
  tutorial: 0
  storyClass: 3
  header: "World Tour Auditions \u2014 KAITO"
  playerStarterDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4dbb0110f192af77177c31f2ded46d3, type: 2}
  prologue:
    lines:
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1c76d800f811e9349b16b1e2ec73ab85, type: 3}
      text: KAITO's phone plays the same chorus again. Miku looks over from her seat.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Still watching that clip?
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: -6467469513183496125, guid: 64258669bcda46446a650c15765c381a, type: 3}
    - speaker: KAITO
      portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c2d336396bb9cb64e8352113d192af51, type: 3}
      text: It's past a hundred thousand views!
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 6526448974759205420, guid: 34e291faf589f6348b04fb7f63ff288c, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 4311828083851245686, guid: 0ed4ac1d21af8974a8e3b903b5a7c0c3, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: That's great! Does anyone know the next verse?
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 5531041605552728420, guid: 8a62fd28134ed2841aa676a65b561ae9, type: 3}
    - speaker: KAITO
      portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Not yet. I'm entering the auditions to fix that.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: -8564549143955694275, guid: 431c2f7904cbc9340908c7fb55bd67b1, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 531467281934478826, guid: b5204f013456e4745a67aceb894cb700, type: 3}
    - speaker: Miku
      portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ebea650ba54e39342a2907330c193e29, type: 3}
      text: Then you'd better get rehearsing!
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 3726713837962234875, guid: 1e5c86882b65c85449ca8dfa842f3d59, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 5531041605552728420, guid: 8a62fd28134ed2841aa676a65b561ae9, type: 3}
  epilogue:
    lines:
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: caacf738306f3f243a0a7b5c1e66e5b9, type: 3}
      text: KAITO has won the headline spot. Backstage, he's trying to squeeze the
        words NEXT SHOW onto a small sign.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 7674018612228396797, guid: 87a8d465a23a180429198277114a8403, type: 3}
    - speaker: Len
      portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: You're still making that sign?
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 2109474199129327443, guid: 3464634288aedf349aea48de0f10dcdc, type: 3}
    - speaker: KAITO
      portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Of course! People keep asking where they can hear the full song.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 6526448974759205420, guid: 34e291faf589f6348b04fb7f63ff288c, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 7674018612228396797, guid: 87a8d465a23a180429198277114a8403, type: 3}
    - speaker: Len
      portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: f59308f04c385614bb04cd445f366120, type: 3}
      text: Aren't they about to hear it right now?
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 2109474199129327443, guid: 3464634288aedf349aea48de0f10dcdc, type: 3}
    - speaker: KAITO
      portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8fc2202936ac6d24eb745b299aecb062, type: 3}
      text: That's tonight. I'm thinking about the next concert!
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 6526448974759205420, guid: 34e291faf589f6348b04fb7f63ff288c, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 7674018612228396797, guid: 87a8d465a23a180429198277114a8403, type: 3}
    - speaker: Len
      portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
      voiceline: {fileID: 0}
      text: Haha! One show at a time, KAITO.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: -6252771093854531909, guid: d8ae485ba1dc9cd47832f3126448021c, type: 3}
    - speaker: Narrator
      portrait: {fileID: 0}
      voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 1a07c2061a74d1e458acf4b765d7ca82, type: 3}
      text: KAITO laughs, sets the sign by the entrance, and hurries onstage as the
        audience calls his name.
      avatars:
      - slot: 1
        sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
      - slot: 4
        sprite: {fileID: 1275116586176032080, guid: 715a83d076871134280f70cb8c7d6033, type: 3}
  auditions:
  - opponent: 0
    deckDescription: Miku strengthens nearby allies and shares influence to build
      a powerful group of performers.
    location: The Lantern Courtyard
    auditionText: An audition against Miku.
    firstClearReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 49b34a7a26ce25b4eb71319e94a4d12c, type: 2}
    easyDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2c3ebb934c6964f3099f5bca55ebf727, type: 2}
    mediumDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e25a40858a935d10bde6f93df11bc4d9, type: 2}
    hardDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 1e660b9fdcb991ade24445970dfdd6ed, type: 2}
    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Someone in the food queue is singing KAITO's famous chorus. Unfortunately,
          they've got the lyrics wrong.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -434653091246056264, guid: ad033b83d33c6dc45a9d86abcdcc004c, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: That's not quite how it goes...
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6149762242164147661, guid: c3005a6e00678e3419d81925b5c2da6a, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ebea650ba54e39342a2907330c193e29, type: 3}
        text: They're having fun!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -5784461528446217249, guid: 0d1a9c5c749493e4db30ed7310bc43ef, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 31f0af8d5b85bfc46bfac233e7b178b9, type: 3}
        text: "I know, I know. It's just\u2014there's a whole second verse!"
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -7700675349355249711, guid: 222d137e6ff11a04283439eac4703c03, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -434653091246056264, guid: ad033b83d33c6dc45a9d86abcdcc004c, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Then sing it! I'm curious too.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3596205292311179843, guid: 7900352c976a7424a83c4fd2fc3f494f, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5531041605552728420, guid: 8a62fd28134ed2841aa676a65b561ae9, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 2c6701a018f1b0a429bb4ad9e5451294, type: 3}
        text: You haven't heard it either?!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -1971943863084206274, guid: 0bca34c626aa4694aaf31971b87bd402, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 4311828083851245686, guid: 0ed4ac1d21af8974a8e3b903b5a7c0c3, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: KAITO wins. A few people near the stalls call for the second verse
          again.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a59bc86f29d52704abf931ea80533273, type: 3}
        text: Wait, you want that part?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -1971943863084206274, guid: 0bca34c626aa4694aaf31971b87bd402, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -772454078125462199, guid: c27636dc5f7cbbb468012701b90daea9, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: They were singing along by the end!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -7753276395421877545, guid: 710cc76e5bee0ef47a514d68f1f7b013, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5531041605552728420, guid: 8a62fd28134ed2841aa676a65b561ae9, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I spent ages writing those lyrics, you know.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -8564549143955694275, guid: 431c2f7904cbc9340908c7fb55bd67b1, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 531467281934478826, guid: b5204f013456e4745a67aceb894cb700, type: 3}
      - speaker: Miku
        portrait: {fileID: 855061685892153893, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 7cb7756fb36d98e4584468b0432f0441, type: 3}
        text: And now you've got backup singers. Very enthusiastic ones.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3726713837962234875, guid: 1e5c86882b65c85449ca8dfa842f3d59, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -5784461528446217249, guid: 0d1a9c5c749493e4db30ed7310bc43ef, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 650f7dbd0a116eb4eae5a07206b38f2c, type: 3}
        text: Haha! All right, one more time!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4067148055806570340, guid: 63bc681a22b302b4697f4c06ebb49c41, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -434653091246056264, guid: ad033b83d33c6dc45a9d86abcdcc004c, type: 3}
  - opponent: 1
    deckDescription: Len weakens and removes opposing performers to control Center
      Stage.
    location: The Rooftop Theatre
    auditionText: An audition against Len.
    firstClearReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a01de200ad86aeb468ba23823340d021, type: 2}
    easyDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2d8ba78264a734a6f9b87166143f8fff, type: 2}
    mediumDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b4189a5eb614f2b7b3b516155fa0906e, type: 2}
    hardDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 037327c14cbdf792dec514f0cc1dd2b3, type: 2}
    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Len pulls a worn concert ticket from his notebook as KAITO walks up.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -7316959908947235806, guid: cdbe4e0629394454fb7d1830a6b440d8, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: KAITO! Could you sign this?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7223590954562643371, guid: 443d92ae47d239f4fbd9198ba873d265, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: "Of course! Oh, that show\u2014the wind took my set list."
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4067148055806570340, guid: 63bc681a22b302b4697f4c06ebb49c41, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -7316959908947235806, guid: cdbe4e0629394454fb7d1830a6b440d8, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: So that long pause wasn't planned?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -6317423667150299997, guid: 93cb99591fd4be445b3887ccb01be9a0, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -8751352758729138934, guid: d741e82c80bfba94dab9c3062b8c8110, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I was waiting for someone to bring it back.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6506257976614099797, guid: e953fd9f6a3a3334884fede5ea8b3148, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -8936150323484664188, guid: 606b73881be89c5458cf32485a5a036b, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I thought it was dramatic!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -8751352758729138934, guid: d741e82c80bfba94dab9c3062b8c8110, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: After KAITO's win, Len hands him a demo with a handwritten track list.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7674018612228396797, guid: 87a8d465a23a180429198277114a8403, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I made you a recording. It's a bit rough.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 2109474199129327443, guid: 3464634288aedf349aea48de0f10dcdc, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: A song of your own? I'd love to hear it.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6526448974759205420, guid: 34e291faf589f6348b04fb7f63ff288c, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7674018612228396797, guid: 87a8d465a23a180429198277114a8403, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Just ignore the second verse. I'm fixing it.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 2109474199129327443, guid: 3464634288aedf349aea48de0f10dcdc, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Now I'm curious about the second verse.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -8564549143955694275, guid: 431c2f7904cbc9340908c7fb55bd67b1, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7674018612228396797, guid: 87a8d465a23a180429198277114a8403, type: 3}
      - speaker: Len
        portrait: {fileID: -3029326035077730249, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: KAITO!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3726713837962234875, guid: 1e5c86882b65c85449ca8dfa842f3d59, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -6684565600080182894, guid: 81787a12260dd21419b00634fb644544, type: 3}
  - opponent: 2
    deckDescription: Rin creates tokens and turns discards and performers leaving
      the stage into bonuses.
    location: The Tram Depot
    auditionText: An audition against Rin.
    firstClearReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b5505428e426eec4f8c562af1fb8880b, type: 2}
    easyDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0aa8f72f3a952f6ff9caeb6930ca41e8, type: 2}
    mediumDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bad97a986d7fb1382273766afced01f8, type: 2}
    hardDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a10f728ff1af456731f0eb0cfb8904fa, type: 2}
    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Rin leans over KAITO's shoulder while he reads comments on his phone.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 4151303731112465946, guid: cf77a782e36c6924199896506136f4f3, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Still checking those numbers?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7355067111040609753, guid: e47f0b211c7a9ca4f9fa87c85034581c, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Just seeing what people think.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6506257976614099797, guid: e953fd9f6a3a3334884fede5ea8b3148, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 4151303731112465946, guid: cf77a782e36c6924199896506136f4f3, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: 'Then here''s my review: you''re taking forever to start.'
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 7355067111040609753, guid: e47f0b211c7a9ca4f9fa87c85034581c, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: That's a little harsh, don't you think?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -1971943863084206274, guid: 0bca34c626aa4694aaf31971b87bd402, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 4151303731112465946, guid: cf77a782e36c6924199896506136f4f3, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Want a better review? Beat me first!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -7753276395421877545, guid: 710cc76e5bee0ef47a514d68f1f7b013, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -5737405312357465230, guid: 25b3083561c08624e8c1142bcd67678c, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: KAITO wins, but the crowd immediately starts chanting for another song.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -7753276395421877545, guid: 710cc76e5bee0ef47a514d68f1f7b013, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -6891413683278241132, guid: 0561decc7a86c4d42b17bcc8fbdc96f7, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Hah! Looks like you're not getting off that easily.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -5737405312357465230, guid: 25b3083561c08624e8c1142bcd67678c, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I hadn't planned an encore.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -1971943863084206274, guid: 0bca34c626aa4694aaf31971b87bd402, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 1008211201124965473, guid: 430621e623a778b47bc4f779618698db, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Seriously? You've got all these people right here!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -7753276395421877545, guid: 710cc76e5bee0ef47a514d68f1f7b013, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -6891710502897521986, guid: c688d2633af154e4b9f2194e663a7494, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Well, do you know the harmony?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6506257976614099797, guid: e953fd9f6a3a3334884fede5ea8b3148, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -6498270370585485129, guid: 6a005da741980b346901fdcc3c26ab52, type: 3}
      - speaker: Rin
        portrait: {fileID: 1730541596440252085, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Obviously. Move over!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -8036308041886742708, guid: 9c688388a046dd24dbbc30ee2987acc9, type: 3}
  - opponent: 4
    deckDescription: Meiko creates new cards and shares keywords to strengthen her
      performers.
    location: The Converted Cinema
    auditionText: An audition against MEIKO.
    firstClearReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e8e9644dad15eb64b94ca2f5ba1969b4, type: 2}
    easyDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 066951dfb2fabf738bf0d86706f3ce72, type: 2}
    mediumDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 667cedfedc6bc5f803e6556c38c79a7f, type: 2}
    hardDeck: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 25f74ba3e4be98bdaac0713570db66b4, type: 2}
    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: KAITO studies a promotional message on his phone. MEIKO glances at
          his expression.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5979520765731624643, guid: 97abf828f29ca514ca6d72471346fdc0, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Bad news?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 1120887921928544082, guid: c84a1dbbe04dc854eb3a3c88bb4bdc39, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: They want another fifteen-second clip. The exact same chorus.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6149762242164147661, guid: c3005a6e00678e3419d81925b5c2da6a, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5979520765731624643, guid: 97abf828f29ca514ca6d72471346fdc0, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Well, are you going to give them one?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 659807028895115265, guid: d5deaaf6772957344b6b32b1640b27d3, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I was hoping to sing the whole thing for once.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6149762242164147661, guid: c3005a6e00678e3419d81925b5c2da6a, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Then put the phone down. You've got a stage right there.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -3391162939266002076, guid: a185e68c9523bca4491339ca00ed0447, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: KAITO comes backstage after singing the whole song, still out of breath.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 8756508170796686454, guid: d93bc75ba5d83d14f859334df5b225e0, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: They stayed! Even for the quiet verse.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6526448974759205420, guid: 34e291faf589f6348b04fb7f63ff288c, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Good. You looked pretty happy up there.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 1521368860836332526, guid: 18538c62a586e8e40880ac3a43b0ccca, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I was! Do you think they'd want an encore?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6526448974759205420, guid: 34e291faf589f6348b04fb7f63ff288c, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 8756508170796686454, guid: d93bc75ba5d83d14f859334df5b225e0, type: 3}
      - speaker: MEIKO
        portrait: {fileID: -9194733545542927407, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Probably. But have some water first.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 659807028895115265, guid: d5deaaf6772957344b6b32b1640b27d3, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Okay. Then an encore!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6526448974759205420, guid: 34e291faf589f6348b04fb7f63ff288c, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -5024050331173424593, guid: 958fcfd1579699b4f92d3293e00f0594, type: 3}
  - opponent: 5
    deckDescription: Luka contests Center Stage and builds audience score to unlock
      discounts and stronger buffs.
