    before:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: KAITO has his phone out, ready to share a clip of Luka rehearsing.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 5903908461516492951, guid: 8c8bebc2cb7e56f4c971ca55f27f8852, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5296954397734636559, guid: 88015ca618f77154aaacf58d9c875728, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: That sounded lovely. Mind if I post it?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4067148055806570340, guid: 63bc681a22b302b4697f4c06ebb49c41, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5296954397734636559, guid: 88015ca618f77154aaacf58d9c875728, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Not yet. I still don't know who wrote the song.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -6317423667150299997, guid: 93cb99591fd4be445b3887ccb01be9a0, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 2541232186797710645, guid: 8c2198f91143d7040ab0170e51459e2c, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Oh. I was about to credit you.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -1971943863084206274, guid: 0bca34c626aa4694aaf31971b87bd402, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Which would make things rather awkward if the writer saw it.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: -7753276395421877545, guid: 710cc76e5bee0ef47a514d68f1f7b013, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 2541232186797710645, guid: 8c2198f91143d7040ab0170e51459e2c, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Right. Good thing I asked first!
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 4067148055806570340, guid: 63bc681a22b302b4697f4c06ebb49c41, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
    after:
      lines:
      - speaker: Narrator
        portrait: {fileID: 0}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: KAITO shows Luka a draft post asking who wrote her unsigned melody.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: I included the opening notes. What do you think?
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6506257976614099797, guid: e953fd9f6a3a3334884fede5ea8b3148, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5296954397734636559, guid: 88015ca618f77154aaacf58d9c875728, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: Much better. But please change that photo.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3997827281134827966, guid: 4dd0976292bb9044fa8be6053c057a52, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 2541232186797710645, guid: 8c2198f91143d7040ab0170e51459e2c, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: You look very thoughtful.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 6149762242164147661, guid: c3005a6e00678e3419d81925b5c2da6a, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: 5076353916888053700, guid: 76bcca590ddfebc49b7f79afec057bfc, type: 3}
      - speaker: Luka
        portrait: {fileID: 3078160648837955091, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: KAITO. My eyes are closed.
        avatars:
        - slot: 1
          sprite: {fileID: 3342472002854934847, guid: bb9fbdd48b2c8d14886a01142a8417df, type: 3}
        - slot: 4
          sprite: {fileID: -5160738886049205843, guid: 2083c9a0add72a44ea80fe0b715f4776, type: 3}
      - speaker: KAITO
        portrait: {fileID: -2876897028097707340, guid: 29b6669444f918e4ead6af724b83a075, type: 3}
        voiceline: {fileID: 0}
        text: ...I'll change it.
        avatars:
